error: `${?...}` must follow a comparison operator, but follows `BETWEEN`.
       Supported: = <> != < > <= >= LIKE ILIKE
       Only predicates of the form `col = ${?x}` are unambiguously removable: `BETWEEN ${?lo} AND ${?hi}` would leave `WHERE age BETWEEN $1`, and `LIMIT`/`OFFSET`/`ORDER BY` are not predicates at all.
       Make the value unconditional via `COALESCE(${x}, <default>)`, use a plain bind `${...}`, or give the condition its own `AND` clause.
